[{"title":"乙未夏五月初三日夜梦侍朝因追想平日所见成绝句三十八首 其二十九","author":"黄淮","text":"千载龙门彻底清，喜逢六合正升平。\n泰山如砺河如带，地久天长拱帝京。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49844,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙未夏五月初三日夜梦侍朝因追想平日所见成绝句三十八首 其三十","author":"黄淮","text":"曾闻麟趾咏周诗，郊薮由来罕见之。\n况复远夷来贡献，故知德泽遍坤维。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49845,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙未夏五月初三日夜梦侍朝因追想平日所见成绝句三十八首 其三十一","author":"黄淮","text":"斲就穹碑著孝思，坤灵兆瑞献神龟。\n非铜非石天然态，宛似呈书出洛时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49846,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙未夏五月初三日夜梦侍朝因追想平日所见成绝句三十八首 其三十二","author":"黄淮","text":"黎庶安居遍野桑，野蚕成茧动成筐。\n锦被织成供寝庙，缄縢犹自有天香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49847,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙未夏五月初三日夜梦侍朝因追想平日所见成绝句三十八首 其三十三","author":"黄淮","text":"时清玉烛自调和，川岳呈祥瑞应多。\n才见驺虞仪殿陛，又看列郡献嘉禾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49848,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙未夏五月初三日夜梦侍朝因追想平日所见成绝句三十八首 其三十四","author":"黄淮","text":"德馨发闻格皇天，二气冲和出醴泉。\n满贮金壶叨赐饮，涓流入口可延年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49849,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙未夏五月初三日夜梦侍朝因追想平日所见成绝句三十八首 其三十五","author":"黄淮","text":"星垂天乳夜光寒，甘露凝珠湿未乾。\n清晓寝园供荐罢，内臣擎出赐千官。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49850,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙未夏五月初三日夜梦侍朝因追想平日所见成绝句三十八首 其三十六","author":"黄淮","text":"天闲十二皆龙种，风骨棱棱画不成。\n内苑曾经调习后，牵来时向御前呈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49851,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙未夏五月初三日夜梦侍朝因追想平日所见成绝句三十八首 其三十七","author":"黄淮","text":"象笏罗袍间绣衣，斓斑五采绚朝晖。\n退朝擎出人皆羡，知是金门拜赐归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49852,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙未夏五月初三日夜梦侍朝因追想平日所见成绝句三十八首 其三十八","author":"黄淮","text":"频年饱食大官羊，珍品黄封取次尝。\n覆育恩同天地广，铭心刻骨誓难忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49853,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丙申南还舟发通州","author":"黄淮","text":"官舸乘风五两轻，寒流拍岸浪花生。\n张家湾上频回首，记取南还第一程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49854,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临清道中","author":"黄淮","text":"野水萦纡野岸回，半川晴雪荻花开。\n舟人指点疏林外，茅屋人家有旧醅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49855,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟次济宁柳色未改澹斋有诗因次其韵","author":"黄淮","text":"济宁南下接通津，杨柳冬来色尚新。\n自是圣恩深雨露，坐令枯朽总回春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49856,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吕梁洪","author":"黄淮","text":"崭崭乱石矗戈矛，狭束狂澜撼地浮。\n疏凿尚存神禹迹，万年不共水东流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49857,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚步二首 其一","author":"黄淮","text":"閒向庭阶步绿苔，萧萧风叶扑人来。\n客情正是无聊赖，惟见寒鸦日往回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49858,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚步二首 其二","author":"黄淮","text":"閒向庭阶步绿苔，侧身南望独徘徊。\n遥知风雨重阳节，三径荒凉菊自开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49859,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"勉子","author":"黄淮","text":"男儿立志要轩昂，莫共闾阎较短长。\n未必儒冠能见误，灯窗努力继书芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49860,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晓","author":"黄淮","text":"闻说山花烂熳开，春光欺我暗相催。\n谁知寂寞伤情处，斜月穿窗梦觉来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49861,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春","author":"黄淮","text":"孤馆凄凉客思淹，忽闻春暮半开帘。\n东风绿遍阶前草，何事偏教鬓雪添。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49862,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋不见月","author":"黄淮","text":"几处笙歌倚画楼，月华最好是中秋。\n嫦娥只恐伤离思，云幕重重不上钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49863,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尝柑","author":"黄淮","text":"分得黄柑入口尝，指尖犹带洞庭霜。\n却思昔日陪春宴，擎出金盘满殿香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49864,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪","author":"黄淮","text":"几度冲寒候早朝，锦衣光彩照璚瑶。\n于今客里愁如积，不共冰花向日消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49865,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和省斋冬至诗韵三首 其一","author":"黄淮","text":"葭飞玉琯蔼阳和，况是清时雨露多。\n收拾琴书买归棹，半江春水绿生波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49866,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和省斋冬至诗韵三首 其二","author":"黄淮","text":"故里交游高谊在，亨途宦业盛名多。\n满怀清思谁能似，月浸寒潭水不波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49867,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和省斋冬至诗韵三首 其三","author":"黄淮","text":"暮年白发叹蹉跎，蚤岁承恩得意多。\n莲炬夜然铃阁雨，綵毫晴蘸凤池波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49868,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用韵简濂泉","author":"黄淮","text":"诗法年来孰与过，清新好似少陵多。\n云开华岳飞秋隼，露洗芙蕖映绿波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49869,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又用韵简友人二首 其一","author":"黄淮","text":"曾听邻鸡并晓珂，好怀还向客边多。\n诗才倾写千寻瀑，雅量涵容沧海波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49870,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又用韵简友人二首 其二","author":"黄淮","text":"朝回骢马玉为珂，燕寝凝香得趣多。\n酒量鲸吞翻海月，簟纹龟绉浥湘波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49871,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄来绵衣宽博甚揣情因赋","author":"黄淮","text":"金剪拈来下手难，几回挥泪拭朱颜。\n遥知腰带围频减，未忍裁教尺度悭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49872,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜","author":"黄淮","text":"朔风吹冷透衾裀，铃柝交鸣聒耳频。\n展转无眠愁思剧，却疑羲驭夜停轮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49873,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛丑遇赦后未释","author":"黄淮","text":"雨露覃恩焕凤纶，岂知屈蠖未全伸。\n愁来羞看墙东柳，一度春风一度新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49874,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见飞絮","author":"黄淮","text":"莫怪年来鬓易霜，柢缘愁里度春光。\n杨花何事浑无赖，也逐东风过短墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49875,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谨和家父寄来诗韵四首 其一","author":"黄淮","text":"养亲深愧闵曾贤，忧患频烦远见怜。\n一札书来肠寸断，哭声痛彻九重天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49876,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谨和家父寄来诗韵四首 其二","author":"黄淮","text":"跋涉艰危一病躯，幸蒙庆祐未沦徂。\n愁来懒向檐前立，羞见林间反哺乌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49877,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谨和家父寄来诗韵四首 其三","author":"黄淮","text":"读书宁不志希贤，薄劣无成空自怜。\n何日重蒙优诏许，斑斓戏舞乐尧天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49878,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谨和家父寄来诗韵四首 其四","author":"黄淮","text":"每凭鱼雁问乡闾，亲旧于今半已殂。\n屈指别来经数载，流光迅速逐飞乌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49879,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵初春二首 其一","author":"黄淮","text":"休问前三与后三，短襦破帽一征衫。\n今朝镜里看衰貌，惭愧萧条雪满簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49880,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵初春二首 其二","author":"黄淮","text":"数九时光已再三，东风送暖入青衫。\n恩光拟逐阳和至，南郭看花笑盍簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49881,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见花","author":"黄淮","text":"乞得花枝洒泪看，满怀愁绪万千端。\n故园亦有繁桃李，门掩东风暮雨寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49882,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春次韵","author":"黄淮","text":"薄雾笼云冻渐消，柳芽凝碧透冰条。\n缘知天近阳和早，便觉风光胜昨朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49883,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆故乡","author":"黄淮","text":"栝岭东头是故乡，碧天云树思茫茫。\n瓯江直与沧溟接，不及羁人别恨长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49884,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墙外槐树","author":"黄淮","text":"绿泛晴阴过短墙，金英争压桂花黄。\n一从愁里看秋色，几度乡关举子忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49885,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邻家伐去墙外柳戏成一绝","author":"黄淮","text":"无复柔丝拂短墙，空馀烟霭送斜阳。\n邻家料得多深意，不使春娇恼客肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49886,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南乡子 七夕嘲女牛","author":"黄淮","text":"一叶井梧飘。\n玉宇凉生暑渐消。\n乞巧佳人传报道，今宵。\n牛女双星会鹊桥。\n银汉夜迢迢。\n风露无声湿翠翘。\n只恐明朝容易过，何劳。\n瓜果庭中远见招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49887,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临江仙 中秋","author":"黄淮","text":"云净碧天秋似水，须臾飞上冰轮。\n山河倒影绝纤尘。\n婵娟千里共，景物一番新。\n老我此身犹是客，蟾宫桂子曾分。\n今宵见月倍伤神。\n嫦娥如解，事休照别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49888,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蝶恋花 人九日","author":"黄淮","text":"迅速光阴乌兔走。\n寂寞圜扉，两度逢重九。\n梦里登高还似旧。\n觉来不管愁眉绉。\n圣德仁恩覃九有。\n白发青衫，准拟蒙宽宥。\n归去高堂重献寿。\n金樽满泛黄花酒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49889,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清平乐 元正","author":"黄淮","text":"柳颦梅笑。\n别院东风早。\n凤吹隔云声缥缈。\n应是蓬莱仙岛。\n吾侪久已沉沦。\n持杯试祝东君。\n好趁阳和时节，螭头共听丝纶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49890,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临江仙 元夕","author":"黄淮","text":"忆昔帝城三五夜，簪缨曾侍宸游。\n山移鳌背对龙楼。\n一天星斗下，万文瑞光浮。\n箫鼓声中催赐饮，归来月在帘钩。\n而今白发叹淹留。\n寒窗灯影里，飞梦绕瀛洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49891,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西江月 冬至","author":"黄淮","text":"逗暖梅梢破玉，迎长葭琯飞灰。\n群阴消尽一阳回。\n云物今朝献瑞。\n自叹人生易老，那堪节序频催。\n东风次第送春来。\n又是一番光采。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49892,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹊桥仙 除夕","author":"黄淮","text":"梅英送腊，椒盘迎瑞，争羡屠苏先酌。\n红炉画阁沸笙歌，谁解道、羁人萧索。\n光阴撚指，韶华过眼，万斛清愁如昨。\n明朝试说向东风，好为我、一齐吹却。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49893,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 正旦代家人","author":"黄淮","text":"何事东风太薄情。\n愁边忽忽换新正。\n柳眉梅靥为谁荣。\n宝胜羞看肠欲断，同心暗结泪先零。\n何时重整凤鸾盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49894,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风入松 拟去妇词","author":"黄淮","text":"落红万点委苍苔。\n春事半尘埃。\n满怀愁绪知多少，思量遍、无计安排。\n好似风中飞絮，时时拂去还来。\n当年鱼水正和谐。\n两意绝嫌猜。\n谁知命薄多乖阻，箫声远、零落天涯。\n破镜终期再合，梦魂长绕阳台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49895,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浪淘沙 七夕遇雨","author":"黄淮","text":"牛女未成欢。\n别意相关。\n几回偷把泪珠弹。\n散作一天凉雨过，秋满人间。\n瓜果谩堆盘。\n夜漏将阑。\n佳人惆怅蹙春山。\n孤负穿针良会也，空倚阑干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49896,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹦鹉曲 偶记北乐府咏渔父鹦鹉曲又名黑漆努晁无咎赓和甚多惜未及樵耕牧因次韵足成四首 其一 次韵咏樵耕牧","author":"黄淮","text":"侬家少室山中住。\n是个半鹘突樵父。\n蹑苍苔、穿遍疏林，担上横挑风雨。\n倦来时、藉草观棋，柯烂不知回去。\n有幽人、要觅行踪，试听我、歌声起处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49897,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹦鹉曲 偶记北乐府咏渔父鹦鹉曲又名黑漆努晁无咎赓和甚多惜未及樵耕牧因次韵足成四首 其二","author":"黄淮","text":"侬家五柳庄前住。\n是个没牵挂耕父。\n趁春忙、短笠轻蓑，耕破一犁春雨。\n到閒时、浊酒频篘，一任邻翁来去。\n醉磨跎、携个青藜，刚走到、云山深处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49898,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹦鹉曲 偶记北乐府咏渔父鹦鹉曲又名黑漆努晁无咎赓和甚多惜未及樵耕牧因次韵足成四首 其三","author":"黄淮","text":"侬家笠泽矶头住。\n是个快活煞村父。\n几回将、牧笛横吹，声断楚天秋雨。\n晚来时、牛背如舟，稳载斜阳归去。\n掩柴扉、醉饮三杯，这的是、浮生美处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49899,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜春来 七夕二首 其一","author":"黄淮","text":"凉飙轻约银河浪，灵鹊新成织女桥。\n两旗关处瑞香飘。\n欢未了、休遣漏声高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49900,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜春来 七夕二首 其二","author":"黄淮","text":"谁言七夕佳期远，争似人间别意多。\n秋风衰鬓渐双皤。\n何日可、归卧白云窝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49901,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉太平 秋思","author":"黄淮","text":"西风暮钟。\n夜雨疏桐。\n一声声、透入梦魂中。\n正鸳衾半空。\n心猿恨锁愁谁共。\n神龟兆协占频中。\n宾鸿声杳信难通。\n何时再逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49902,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙子 拟中秋赏月","author":"黄淮","text":"月奁初揭镜光寒。\n云幕高褰桂影团。\n风帘微动金波乱。\n遍乾坤、清气满倚南楼，心眼俱宽。\n酒量倾湖海，箫声叶凤鸾。\n且尽清欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49903,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"普天乐 中秋自述","author":"黄淮","text":"晚风清。\n浮云净。\n一轮初上，千里同明。\n坡仙俊丽词，庾亮疏狂兴。\n老我凄凉应难并。\n对婵娟、且诉平生。\n三年倦客，几番归梦，万斛离情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49904,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"叠字醉太平 中秋遇雨","author":"黄淮","text":"乱纷纷，痴云骤拥。\n淡濛濛，薄雾轻笼。\n浙泠泠，蟾宫深锁雨声中。\n闷恹恹，嫦娥玉容。\n急煎煎，登楼庾亮情难纵。\n意悬悬，开樽李白诗难咏。\n路漫漫，吹箫弄玉去难从。\n恨悠悠，更长漏永。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49905,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙子过折桂令 九日思亲","author":"黄淮","text":"翠丝风剪绿杨稀。\n缬锦霜凋红叶飞。\n金钱露染黄花缀，正龙山佳会，集望庭闱。\n无限伤悲。\n任泪雨，缘腮落，将愁山，着意推。\n盼佳期，何日南归。\n盼佳期，何日南归。\n水远山遥，目断神驰。\n齧指情深，趋庭训切，戏綵心违。\n寄信息、难凭锦鲤，对茱萸、慵泛金杯。\n暮景休催。\n壮志难摧。\n仰望皇恩，趋拜天墀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49906,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朝天曲 立冬","author":"黄淮","text":"晓风啸空，报道冬初动。\n萧萧败叶响寒丛，鸳瓦霜华冻。\n兽炭炉围羊羔酒，共醉笙歌锦帐中。\n病翁固穷，冷落了梅花梦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49907,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落梅风 冬至二阕 其一","author":"黄淮","text":"玄冥令，广漠风。\n将大地，一阳催动。\n喜云物，书祥奏九重。\n庆丰年，万民歌颂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49908,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落梅风 冬至二阕 其二","author":"黄淮","text":"愁千种，别几年。\n想故园，梅花开遍。\n欲待报平安，频将锦字传。\n空望断、碧天边，数行飞雁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49909,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿江口舟中见月 其一","author":"唐文凤","text":"扁舟宿江口，露下夜初永。\n菰蒲猎猎声，叶飐风不静。\n缺月出未高，微波翻碎影。\n王事有程期，无寐自深省。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49910,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿江口舟中见月 其二","author":"唐文凤","text":"舟行帆飞驶，夜泊桡暂停。\n月出湖水白，云开野山青。\n沙平集下鹭，风回约流萤。\n迢迢乡心切，渔笛声难听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49911,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿江口舟中见月 其三","author":"唐文凤","text":"辞家日已远，到县程将近。\n是身如蓬梗，飘泊何由定。\n石斗浪声齐，月摹人影正。\n江神愿乞灵，明朝风力顺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49912,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月二日因公出诣城隍庙行香同高判簿郑长司黄广文及儒士钟子常坐庙门之下观一邑境内之溪山喜而有作 其一","author":"唐文凤","text":"我来宰斯邑，倏忽十月馀。\n县庭纷聚讼，好怀那得舒。\n自春已踰夏，光景过隙驹。\n人生百年间，何为事区区。\n今晨偶公出，庙门坐斯须。\n山光列图画，树声杂笙竽。\n欣然乐閒适，不受凡俗拘。\n吟眸豁无际，群峰环四隅。\n愧匪廊庙器，亦非山泽臞。\n自甘牛刀试，民瘼何由苏。\n所期岁丰稔，忧时嗟术疏。\n终当化淳俗，击壤歌唐虞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49913,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]